#: includes/Security/Findings.php:153
msgid "Besides WordPress’s own files and wp-config.php, PHP files here are usually left-over tools or a hacker’s backdoor."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Security/Findings.php:153
msgid "If you don’t know what it’s for, ask your developer or host, then delete it."
msgstr ""

